Package: wolfssl
Version: 3.4.0-r0
Description: wolfSSL Lightweight, Embedded SSL Library
 wolfSSL, formerly CyaSSL, is a lightweight SSL library written in C and
 optimized for embedded and RTOS environments. It can be                Up
 to 20 times smaller than OpenSSL while still supporting                a
 full TLS 1.2 client and server.
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: GPLv2
Architecture: armv7a-vfp-neon
OE: wolfssl
Homepage: http://www.wolfssl.com/yaSSL/Products-wolfssl.html
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.22)
Provides: cyassl
Source: http://www.wolfssl.com/wolfssl-3.4.0.zip
